  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cancer Care for Children in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are currently working with seven government hospitals to improve paediatric oncology services in Bangladesh. We also working with International Children&apos;s Palliative Care Network to improve services for children with life-limiting conditions requiring palliative care.  It&apos;s estimated that around 9,000 to 12,000 children develop cancer in Bangladesh every year. However, unfortunately, only one third receive a proper diagnosis.</narrative>
  </description>
